<title>USA: Corrpro sets shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Corrpro sets shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>MEDINA, Ohio 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corrpro Cos Inc said Friday that its board of directors has adopted a Shareholder Rights Plan in which the rights would become effective after a person or group acquires or announces a tender offer for 20 percent or more of the company's common shares.</p>
<p>Corrpor said that the plan is not in response to any specific effort to acquire control of the company.</p>
</text>
